#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:3
msgid "Schema changes"
msgstr "Modifications de schéma"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:5
msgid ""
"Schema changes are done in Migrations by creating an array that will be "
"parsed by ``\\phpbb\\db\\tools::perform_schema_changes()``."
msgstr ""
"Les modifications de schéma s'effectuent dans les migrations en créant un "
"tableau qui sera analysé par ``\\phpbb\\db\\tools::"
"perform_schema_changes()``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:9
msgid "Basics"
msgstr "Notions de base"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:10
msgid ""
"When performing schema changes, your Migrations class should contain two "
"functions, ``update_schema`` and ``revert_schema``."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque vous effectuez des modifications de schéma, votre classe de "
"migration doit contenir deux fonctions : ``update_schema`` et "
"``revert_schema``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:14
msgid "update_schema"
msgstr "update_schema"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:15
msgid ""
"``update_schema()`` will be called as the **first** step when installing a "
"migration. This makes any database schema changes you need when installing "
"the migration."
msgstr ""
"``update_schema()`` sera appelée comme **première** étape lors de "
"l'installation d'une migration. Elle effectue les modifications de schéma de "
"base de données nécessaires à l'installation de la migration."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:27
msgid "revert_schema"
msgstr "revert_schema"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:29
msgid ""
"``revert_schema()`` will be called when a Migration must be uninstalled "
"(this could happen if the user wants/needs to revert changes by the "
"Migration, a dependency is reverted, or the installation fails and the "
"entire Migration is removed)."
msgstr ""
"``revert_schema()`` sera appelée lorsqu'une migration doit être désinstallée "
"(cela peut se produire si l'utilisateur souhaite/doit annuler les "
"modifications de la migration, si une dépendance est annulée, ou si "
"l'installation échoue et que la migration entière est supprimée)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:34
msgid ""
"The instructions in ``revert_schema()`` should effectively do the exact "
"opposite of what ``update_schema()`` does (e.g. if a table is dropped, "
"revert should add the table with exactly the same columns/keys as it had "
"before it was dropped)"
msgstr ""
"Les instructions de ``revert_schema()`` doivent effectivement faire "
"exactement l'inverse de ce que fait ``update_schema()`` (par exemple, si une "
"table est supprimée, revert doit ajouter la table avec exactement les mêmes "
"colonnes/clés qu'elle avait avant sa suppression)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:47
msgid "What to return"
msgstr "Que renvoyer"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/migrations/schema_changes.rst:48
msgid ""
"The array returned is passed directly, as is, to ``\\phpbb\\db\\tools::"
"perform_schema_changes();``"
msgstr ""
"Le tableau renvoyé est transmis directement, tel quel, à "
"``\\phpbb\\db\\tools::perform_schema_changes();``"

